CTT (Cognitive Task Templates) — minimal structure notes

This folder stores verified evaluation tasks as JSON or JSONL.

Recommended per-task fields:
- task_id: unique stable identifier (string)
- template_id: CTT/template identifier (string)
- input: task prompt + structured inputs (object)
- expected: golden answer / rubric / assertions (object)
- metadata: tags, domain, difficulty, source references (object)

Files:
- tasks.jsonl (recommended): one JSON object per line, UTF-8

